### Metizo API — sample request flow
### Open in IntelliJ / VS Code (REST Client) and run top-to-bottom.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Register a customer
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ama Customer",
  "email": "ama@example.com",
  "password": "secret123",
  "phone": "0240000000",
  "role": "CUSTOMER"
}

### 2. Register an artisan (plumber)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Kofi Plumber",
  "email": "kofi@example.com",
  "password": "secret123",
  "phone": "0240000001",
  "role": "ARTISAN",
  "category": "PLUMBING",
  "bio": "10 years fixing pipes in Accra",
  "location": "Accra"
}

### 3. Login as customer  -> copy the token into @customerToken below
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ama@example.com", "password": "secret123" }

### 4. Login as artisan -> copy the token into @artisanToken below
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "kofi@example.com", "password": "secret123" }

@customerToken = PASTE_CUSTOMER_TOKEN
@artisanToken  = PASTE_ARTISAN_TOKEN

### 5. Customer posts a service request
POST {{host}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Leaking kitchen sink",
  "description": "Water pooling under the sink cabinet",
  "category": "PLUMBING",
  "location": "East Legon, Accra",
  "budget": 300,
  "emergency": true
}

### 6. Artisan browses open requests
GET {{host}}/api/requests?category=PLUMBING
Authorization: Bearer {{artisanToken}}

### 7. Artisan bids on request 1
POST {{host}}/api/requests/1/bids
Authorization: Bearer {{artisanToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 250, "estimatedTime": "2 days", "message": "Can start tomorrow morning" }

### 8. Customer views all bids on the request (cheapest first)
GET {{host}}/api/requests/1/bids
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 9. Customer accepts bid 1 (locks funds in escrow, assigns artisan)
POST {{host}}/api/bids/1/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 10. Artisan starts the job
POST {{host}}/api/requests/1/start
Authorization: Bearer {{artisanToken}}

### 11. Customer confirms completion (releases escrow, credits trust score)
POST {{host}}/api/requests/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 12. Customer leaves a review
POST {{host}}/api/requests/1/review
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 5, "comment": "Fast and clean work!" }

### 13. View escrow ledger entry
GET {{host}}/api/requests/1/escrow
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 14. Smart matching — best plumbers (public)
GET {{host}}/api/artisans/match?category=PLUMBING

### 15. Price-transparency dashboard (public)
GET {{host}}/api/pricing/categories
